WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.530
Mitsuki has an unexpected
visitor from America.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:09.200
It's Ms. Kazumi, who took care of Mitsuki
before she started living here.

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.970
Upon talking with Mitsuki,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.470
Ms. Kazumi promises to find
Eichi's whereabouts in America!

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:19.300
Isn't that great?
Now one of her dreams may come true!

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.900
So, I wonder what's
going to happen today...

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:28.630
Got that?

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:29.670
Yes.

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.970
A live show at this university's
school festival, eh?

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.530
Sounds like fun!

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:09.500
Yeah, really!

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:12.500
Besides, I can't believe that
these beautiful buildings are a school!

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:15.370
It's so different from elementary schools.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:19.530
Oh, they even have a planetarium.
How wonderful!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:20.300
Yeah.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.370
A planetarium...

00:02:31.070 --> 00:02:32.300
Thinking about Eichi again?

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:33.730
Huh? Y-Yeah

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:39.370
In any case, planetariums are so nice.
I want to go there with Takuto.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.070
Jeez, I can't take this anymore!

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:10.630
Wow.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:13.700
There are little shops too.
It's a pretty serious deal!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.770
No! I said I am going!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:20.570
Hey, listen!
We are not here to play around!

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.670
Just for a little bit!

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:27.130
I'll give you some apricot candy
if I win some!

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:29.870
I prefer plums!

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:33.070
Anyway, that's not the point!
Come on, let's go!

00:03:34.870 --> 00:03:37.730
What's happening?
Are they having another dispute?

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:41.630
Yes. Seems like Meroko
wants to go to the booths.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:47.470
Meroko, let's all go together
when we have more time later! Okay?

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:49.470
Okay.

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:54.700
You have...

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:55.900
...a favor to ask?

00:03:55.930 --> 00:04:01.970
Yes. For the live show in the evening,
you perform after Scanty.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:05.200
But before the show,
we have an event in which

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:09.730
we would like Full Moon to make
a guest appearance as a princess.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:13.000
I'm sorry, but it's too sudden.

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:16.800
We heard that it would be a live show,
and we've planned accordingly for that.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.030
But could you...
Please...

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.430
But...

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:26.470
A role of a princess? Sounds like fun!
Ms. Oshige, I want to do it!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.370
What?

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:32.330
Well... If you really want to do it,
Mitsuki, I won't say no.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.170
So that's okay?!
Thank you so much!

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.270
All right!

00:04:36.300 --> 00:04:37.530
Hold on one second!

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:38.930
I didn't say okay yet!

00:04:43.570 --> 00:04:46.830
Well, I guess that's that,
so shall we go somewhere till it's time?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:56.770
Wow, I thought we were going out
when you said we'd go somewhere.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.300
But universities have everything.

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.970
Yes. It's very different
from your school, isn't it?

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:03.670
Yes.

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:12.500
Oh, looks like in universities,
classes are called lectures!

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.970
And they are 90 minutes long!

00:05:15.230 --> 00:05:17.570
On top of that, there are so many
courses that I have never heard of!

00:05:17.900 --> 00:05:18.900
Let's see...

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:23.600
Quantum Mechanics, Psychoacoustics,
Ergonomics, and Cultural Anthropology?

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.030
They sound so difficult,
it's making me dizzy.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.430
But I know that one.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:31.700
Huh? Astronomy?

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:36.100
Oh, that's right!
Eichi was studying astronomy, right?

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:36.900
Yes!

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.330
Not Eichi again!

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:42.000
Oh? You got jealous just now,
didn't you?

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:44.030
What?! No I didn't!

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.970
See! You're getting defensive!
I was right, wasn't I?

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:47.730
No!

00:05:47.970 --> 00:05:49.930
How dare you,
when you have someone like me.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.170
How vexing!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:52.830
Takuto, you are a cheater!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:54.030
Huh?!

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:55.770
Fine, if that's the case...

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.170
I am going to enter this!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:03.630
I'm going to be in it, and make you realize
how attractive Miss Meroko really is!

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.670
You've gotta be kidding.

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:08.430
I'm going to win!
And then, and then...

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.970
<i>Meroko, I didn't realize</i>
<i>how attractive you were.</i>

00:06:16.070 --> 00:06:18.400
<i>I... I...</i>

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:21.170
<i>That's okay, Takuto.</i>
<i>Now you understand.</i>

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.930
<i>- Meroko...</i>
<i>- Takuto...</i>

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:27.970
All right!
Just you wait, Takuto!

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:29.970
Oh! Meroko!
Where are you going?!

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:31.200
Jeez...

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.930
Man, what an idiot.
Just let her be.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.330
- Nice pose!
- Nice pose!

00:06:49.000 --> 00:06:50.630
Don't you want to...

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:53.600
...give us your autograph...

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:56.000
- ...on our biceps?
- ...on our biceps?

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:00.330
Run, Mitsuki!

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:01.100
Huh?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.300
Just hurry!

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:05.970
- Don't be so shy!
- Don't be so shy!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:07.030
Stop right there!

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.630
I spent two years as a popstar and have
ten years of experience as a manager.

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:16.800
I, Masami Oshige, who has lived through
this shrewd world of showbiz, won't let—

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:19.930
you pass!

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.070
Takuto, I can't run anymore!

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.100
Keep going towards that elevator!

00:07:39.230 --> 00:07:40.230
Mitsuki!

00:07:41.930 --> 00:07:44.200
- Give us your autograph!
- Give us your autograph!

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:50.130
- Full Moon!
- Full Moon!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:57.100
Ouch!

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.430
Stop following Full Moon!

00:08:01.030 --> 00:08:02.270
- O-Out of the blue...
- O-Out of the blue...

00:08:02.770 --> 00:08:04.800
- Who the heck are you?!
- Who the heck are you?!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.600
I'm Full Moon's bodyguard!

00:08:09.270 --> 00:08:11.770
<i>What? They can see Takuto?</i>

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.700
A bodyguard, huh?

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.970
Do you wanna fight against us?

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:22.700
Takuto...

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:24.900
What should we do?

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.400
- I-It was unopened!
- I-It was unopened!

00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:37.530
What fight are you talking about?

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:40.430
We can handle empty cans.

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:42.530
But an unopened one...

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.830
- It's such a waste!
- It's such a waste!

00:08:48.870 --> 00:08:51.730
Uh... Well...
You're running away for the wrong reason.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:00.530
What?

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:04.630
Takuto, you can transform into a human!
That's amazing!

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:08.130
Oh, this?
If I concentrate, I can.

00:09:08.670 --> 00:09:14.400
But I spend so much energy to do it
that I can't use any of my other powers.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.830
But Takuto, you were like
a real bodyguard back there.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:18.970
You were so cool!

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:19.770
Wha—;?!

00:09:20.100 --> 00:09:20.770
Thanks!

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:22.400
S-Sure.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.970
Takuto, why don't we
go play for just a bit?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:32.900
No! What if there are more weirdos?!

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:37.970
It'll be fine since you'll be with me.
Right?

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:39.000
Wha—;?!

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:41.130
Come on, let's just go for a while!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:42.470
Hey!

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:08.200
Hey, hey...

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.970
Doesn't this feel like a date?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:19.830
Sexy!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.200
Look this way!

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:29.400
Oh, how stupid.

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:31.830
Come on, didn't you wanna
go to the planetarium?

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.000
Huh? Oh! Wait up, Takuto!

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:45.930
- Wow...
- Wow...

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:50.500
There are so many!
It's beautiful!

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:52.770
Yeah! There are too many stars,

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.970
I can't tell which ones
are which constellation.

00:10:55.270 --> 00:10:59.430
Yeah! Eichi taught me so many of them
a long time ago, but I forgot them.

00:10:59.870 --> 00:11:03.600
The sky I gazed at with Eichi
was so pretty.

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:07.470
B-But I know that one!
There!

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.800
Oh! The Big Dipper!

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:11.900
Yeah.

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:15.470
The Big Dipper is shaped
like a dipper, right?

00:11:17.170 --> 00:11:19.100
And, if that...

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:25.400
<i>If that had water in it,</i>
<i>I'm worried it would spill out.</i>

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:29.400
<i>Don't worry,</i>
<i>there's no water in it!</i>

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:33.270
<i>Oh! I see!</i>
<i>There are stars in it then!</i>

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:37.870
<i>And we see shooting stars when</i>
<i>it's filled so much it overflows?</i>

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:40.230
<i>You may be right.</i>

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:44.470
Now that I think about it,
I was saying strange things,

00:11:46.300 --> 00:11:50.700
but Eichi never made fun of me,
and he always listened to me.

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:54.470
He was really so kind.
Eichi...

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:59.930
Hey, why are you walking away
before it's over?

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.570
Are you upset about something?

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:05.600
Not really.
I just thought it's about time we go back.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.030
Really?

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:07.800
Yeah.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:12.530
You're lying!
You always get mad when I mention Eichi!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:17.330
Well, if you think so,
then why did you talk about Eichi?

00:12:17.630 --> 00:12:18.630
That's...

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.670
I don't know what to do
when you talk about those things!

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:26.100
Besides, I am not
a substitute for Eichi!

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:49.030
MISS FULL MOON'S
GREEN ROOM

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:50.400
Oh no.
MISS FULL MOON'S
GREEN ROOM

00:12:50.400 --> 00:12:50.630
MISS FULL MOON'S
GREEN ROOM

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:54.830
If I can't protect a talent,
I've failed at being a manager, haven't I?

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.070
Oh, sorry.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:02.200
Only authorized people
can come in here.

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.270
What are you talking about, it's me.

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.470
Huh? No... Well...

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:08.500
Takuto! Wait!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.070
What? Y-You're Takuto?

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:13.230
Y-Yeah!

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:16.270
Oh? Umm... But...

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:20.870
Nice to meet you, I'm Oshige.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:23.730
Oh, nice to meet you too, I'm Takuto.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:25.500
Full Moon!

00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:28.300
Please be ready soon!

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:29.600
Yes!

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:35.300
<i>Everyone!</i>
<i>Thank you for waiting!</i>

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:39.100
<i>It's time for our Nandai festival's famous</i>
<i>"Love Love Attack"!</i>

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:45.770
<i>And here is today's princess...</i>
<i>Full Moon!</i>

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:56.800
<i>Hi everyone, I'm Full Moon.</i>
<i>Thank you for having me today!</i>

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:00.600
<i>Well, so, let's get started then!</i>

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:04.830
<i>Here are the candidates who will</i>
<i>compete to be Full Moon's knight.</i>

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:12.230
Looks like it's a pretty big deal.

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:13.270
Yeah...

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:15.300
I wonder if Mitsuki will be all right?

00:14:19.930 --> 00:14:22.330
Those guys!
Why are they here?!

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:27.630
<i>The lucky male students on stage</i>
<i>will participate in many different games</i>

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:30.030
<i>to contend for the princess!</i>

00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:32.930
<i>The winner that remains</i>
<i>at the end of the game</i>

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:35.700
<i>will receive a kiss from Full Moon!</i>

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:36.430
What?

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.200
- All right!
- All right!

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.570
A kiss? I...

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:44.970
So we meet again!

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:46.370
Let's have fun!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.000
S-Sure.

00:14:48.270 --> 00:14:49.330
Hey, you!

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:51.300
You never mentioned
anything about a kiss!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:55.100
Well, the presenter chooses
the prize on a whim.

00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:56.400
It wasn't planned for.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:00.200
What should we do, Takuto?

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:03.070
They might do something
weird to Mitsuki!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:10.030
Takuto, please! Do something about this!
We can't stop the event now!

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:11.730
Please protect Mitsuki!

00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.200
<i>I am not a substitute for Eichi!</i>

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:24.930
Hold it there!

00:15:26.470 --> 00:15:27.970
I'm participating too!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.070
- What?!
- What?!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.170
<i>Oh?!</i>

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:33.670
<i>A new contestant has jumped in!</i>
<i>This is unheard of!</i>

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:36.100
<i>Will the committee okay it?</i>

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:37.230
<i>Takuto!</i>

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:39.470
<i>Okay!</i>

00:15:39.530 --> 00:15:42.800
<i>This is getting fun!</i>
<i>Let's get it started then!</i>

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:45.000
You're the bodyguard we saw!

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:49.430
You were talking so big,
but you're after the kiss prize too!

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:53.100
Shut up! I'll never let
omeone like you win this!

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.630
<i>The first battle is</i>
<i>"Super Spicy Attack"!</i>

00:15:56.830 --> 00:16:00.330
<i>The first 10 people that finish</i>
<i>this super spicy hot pot</i>

00:16:00.370 --> 00:16:02.170
<i>will be able to go on</i>
<i>to the next battle!</i>

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.430
<i>Now, get set.</i>

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.330
<i>Crap, I can't eat hot things.</i>

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.830
<i>Damn!</i>

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.530
<i>Good luck, Takuto.</i>

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:27.430
<i>Takuto...</i>

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:44.470
<i>Time is up!</i>

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:47.130
H-Hot...

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:52.330
I hate spicy things!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.570
<i>This year's Campus Queen is...</i>

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:03.500
<i>Entry number three...</i>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.300
<i>Miss Meroko!</i>

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:11.830
- Meroko!
- Meroko!

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:16.070
And now, a trophy will be given
to the winner, Miss Meroko!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.270
Yay! Thank you!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:25.770
Oh, that must be the event
they were talking about.

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:26.870
Huh?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:30.330
Is that...Takuto?!

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:34.800
Why is he participating?
And he's even in his human form!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:38.370
- Congratulations...
- That Takuto!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.530
Umm... Hey!
Where are you going?!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.730
It's an emergency!
I'll be back to pick it up!

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:44.930
See ya!

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.600
<i>Time's up!</i>

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:52.930
<i>We now have the contestants</i>
<i>that will go on to the final round!</i>

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:57.700
All right!
Way to go Takuto!

00:17:58.130 --> 00:18:02.000
<i>The final battle is</i>
<i>"Hold Your Breath in a Basin Attack"!</i>

00:18:02.600 --> 00:18:07.200
<i>Whoever keeps his head in the basin</i>
<i>the longest is the winner!</i>

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:09.670
I won't let you win!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:10.830
Shut up!

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:13.070
<i>Okay, get set.</i>

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.670
<i>All right, everyone has started now.</i>

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:22.170
<i>Who will be the one to get a kiss</i>
<i>from the beautiful princess?!</i>

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:25.330
<i>I can't lose!</i>

00:18:31.570 --> 00:18:33.530
<i>A kiss if I win!</i>
<i>A kiss if I win!</i>

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.430
<i>A silent battle of men.</i>

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:39.500
<i>And watching over them,</i>
<i>we have Princess Full Moon!</i>

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:41.970
<i>Who could her gaze be on?!</i>

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:47.270
<i>Takuto...</i>

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:55.130
<i>I made him so upset then.</i>
<i>I'm sorry Takuto.</i>

00:18:56.370 --> 00:18:57.370
Takuto...

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:00.830
<i>It's starting to get tough!</i>

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:06.730
<i>Oh? Looks like we have contestants</i>
<i>dropping out one after the other!</i>

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:10.600
Go Takuto!

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:14.200
You won't die even if you don't
breathe for two or three hours!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.000
- Go!
- P-Please calm down!

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:18.930
<i>Now we have</i>
<i>two contestants left.</i>

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:21.970
<i>Who will be the winner</i>
<i>of the victorious crown?!</i>

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.400
<i>A kiss if I win!</i>
<i>Just win!</i>

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:26.400
<i>Now we are in</i>
<i>the most crucial moment!</i>

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:29.830
<i>Judgment will finally be</i>
<i>passed on the two of them!</i>

00:19:50.100 --> 00:19:52.930
I should have trained my lungs too.

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:55.230
<i>We have a knight!</i>

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:58.400
<i>The winner is this one that</i>
<i>jumped into the game, Takuto!</i>

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:01.070
Huh? Me?

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:04.500
Yay! Awesome, Takuto!

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:12.270
<i>Now, Full Moon will</i>
<i>kiss the knight!</i>

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:14.170
Huh? Um...

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:17.870
Hey, you two!
How hot and heavy!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.070
Ms. Oshige...

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.600
W-Well, I guess we
just have to do it.

00:20:21.230 --> 00:20:23.770
Just do it on my forehead
and get it over with.

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.130
O-Okay.

00:20:34.030 --> 00:20:35.500
Just hold it there!

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:39.770
How dare you,
when you have a girl like me!

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:41.400
You cheater!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:42.800
<i>Oh my!</i>

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:44.500
<i>We have an unexpected</i>
<i>development here!</i>

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:49.370
<i>Looks like this year's knight and</i>
<i>this year's Campus Queen were lovers!</i>

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:50.300
No!

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:53.970
Yes! Takuto and I are so in love!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.670
What?!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:57.600
If you want a kiss,
I'll give you one!

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:00.830
Cut it out, you dummy!

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:04.430
You are so shy,
don't run away like that!

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:05.930
Help me!

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.430
Takuto!

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.000
Who is that girl?

00:21:09.500 --> 00:21:15.200
<i>Well, things turned out crazy,</i>
<i>but thank you so much for today, Full Moon.</i>

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.600
<i>Good luck in your live show too!</i>

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:18.500
<i>Yes!</i>

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:32.930
<i>Takuto... Thank you.</i>

00:23:05.870 --> 00:23:08.770
Hey, that mean girl is back.

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:11.800
What?!
You mean, Madoka Wakamatsu?!

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:15.130
Yeah. But she's still arrogant as usual.

00:23:15.270 --> 00:23:17.600
I thought she would've
been a little disheartened

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.630
by losing to Mistuki in
the recording competition,

00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:21.800
but I can't believe
she hasn't changed!

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:25.470
Wait a second.
She's fighting with her manager.

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:27.570
Something seems funny!

00:23:28.230 --> 00:23:31.600
Next time on Full Moon:
"The Real Madoka Wakamatsu."

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:32.970
- Look forward to it!
- Look forward to it!
